WEBVTT

00:16.560 --> 00:18.043
Huh?
啊？

00:18.147 --> 00:19.181
Get away from me money!
钱离我远点！

00:19.285 --> 00:21.319
Daddy! Daddy!
爸爸！爸爸！

00:21.423 --> 00:23.629
I finally figured out
what you can get me
我终于想通了
你能给我什么

00:23.733 --> 00:25.595
for my birthday next week!
下周是我的生日！

00:25.698 --> 00:29.078
I found the perfect boat
for you to buy me!
我找到了完美的船
为了你买我！

00:33.354 --> 00:34.733
Boat?
船？

00:34.836 --> 00:37.767
I never said I'd buy you
a birthday boat!
我从来没有说过要买你
生日船！

00:38.423 --> 00:39.905
<i>Pearl!</i>
<i>珍珠！</i>

00:40.009 --> 00:42.664
<i>If you stop playing that
earsplitting music,</i>
<i>如果你停止玩这个游戏
震耳欲聋的音乐，</i>

00:42.767 --> 00:45.767
<i>I'll buy you a new boat
for your birthday!</i>
<i>我会给你买一艘新船
为了你的生日！</i>

00:47.250 --> 00:48.871
<i>You're not recording me,
are ya?</i>
<i>你没有给我录音，
你是吗？</i>

00:48.974 --> 00:53.629
It's the only boat for me
and it's only 10,000 clams!
这是我唯一的船
而且只有一万只蛤蜊！

00:56.491 --> 00:58.043
T-t-t-t-ten!
十、十！

00:58.147 --> 00:59.388
Th-th-th-thousand?
第、第、千？

00:59.491 --> 01:02.216
Gonna get a new boat!
I'm not bratty!
要去买一艘新船了！
我不淘气！

01:02.319 --> 01:05.388
A birthday boat!
From my daddy!
生日船！
来自我爸爸！

01:09.423 --> 01:11.871
Me and my big mouth!
我和我的大嘴！

01:13.181 --> 01:17.905
There it is, SpongeBob,
me daughter's birthday boat!
就在那里，海绵宝宝，
我女儿的生日船！

01:18.009 --> 01:19.629
I love it!
我喜欢它！

01:19.733 --> 01:21.664
Not the brochure!
不是宣传册！

01:22.733 --> 01:24.043
Oooh!
噢！

01:24.423 --> 01:26.285
Nice fixer-upper,
漂亮的固定器上部，

01:26.388 --> 01:28.457
but why didn't you just buy
a new boat?
但你为什么不直接买
一艘新船？

01:28.560 --> 01:32.974
Because I'm not paying
10,000 clams for a new boat.
因为我不付钱
一艘新船需要 10,000 只蛤蜊。

01:33.491 --> 01:35.664
You're gonna help me
fix up <i>this</i> boat
你会帮助我的
修好<i>这艘</i>船

01:35.767 --> 01:38.216
so it's as good
as the brochure boat!
所以也一样好
作为宣传册船！

01:38.319 --> 01:40.285
Me Pearl will never know
the difference.
我珍珠永远不会知道
差异。

01:43.112 --> 01:44.423
This may take a while.
这可能需要一段时间。

01:44.526 --> 01:46.905
<i>One "a while" later...</i>
<i>“一会儿”之后...</i>

01:52.871 --> 01:53.974
Zow-ie!
Zow-ie！
Zow-ie！
Zow-ie！

01:54.078 --> 01:57.354
This boat looks like it costs
a million clams!
这艘船看起来很贵
一百万只蛤蜊！

01:57.457 --> 01:59.078
Well, at least on the outside.
嗯，至少在外面是这样。

01:59.181 --> 02:02.147
Now we just gotta find an engine
before Pearl wakes up.
现在我们只需要找到一个引擎
在珍珠醒来之前。

02:06.560 --> 02:08.491
My birthday!
我的生日！

02:10.526 --> 02:12.354
We gotta hide!
我们得躲起来！

02:12.457 --> 02:14.112
Pearl's a-coming, boy-o!
珍珠来了，小伙子！

02:18.112 --> 02:19.147
Yow!
哟！

02:19.733 --> 02:22.285
Gonna get a new boat!
I'm not bratty!
要去买一艘新船了！
我不淘气！

02:22.388 --> 02:25.181
A birthday boat!
From my daddy!
生日船！
来自我爸爸！

02:25.285 --> 02:27.423
B-O-A-T!
船！

02:27.526 --> 02:29.009
Boat?
船？

02:33.940 --> 02:36.009
It's the boat that I wanted!
这就是我想要的船！

02:36.664 --> 02:39.319
I love my daddy!
我爱我的爸爸！

02:45.388 --> 02:48.285
I'll take a test drive!
That's the stuff!
我去试驾一下！
就是这样的东西！

02:48.388 --> 02:50.733
I'll be back
before Daddy wakes up!
我会回来的
在爸爸醒来之前！

02:50.836 --> 02:53.043
She can't drive a boat
with no engine.
她不会驾驶船
没有引擎。

02:53.147 --> 02:55.457
- Hey, Pearl!
- Quiet!
- 嘿，珍珠！
- 安静的！

02:55.560 --> 02:58.009
She can't find out
this is a piece of junk!
她查不出来
这是一块垃圾！

02:59.250 --> 03:00.836
Well, how will we do that?
那么，我们该怎么做呢？

03:00.940 --> 03:03.043
Fake it!
<i>We'll</i> be the engine!
假装吧！
<i>我们将</i>成为引擎！

03:10.147 --> 03:11.181
Uh...
呃...

03:14.526 --> 03:15.940
Vroom, vroom!
呜呜呜！

03:19.216 --> 03:23.181
Let's open her up
and see what this baby can do!
让我们打开她的心扉
看看这个宝宝能做什么！

03:26.802 --> 03:29.216
Boy-Bob, me sponge...
男孩鲍勃，我海绵......

03:29.595 --> 03:31.629
You're on axle duty!
你正在轮轴值班！

03:31.733 --> 03:33.147
Aye-Aye, Cap'n!
是啊，船长！

03:37.078 --> 03:41.250
- Ooh! A navigation system!
- Ow!
- 哦！导航系统！
- 噢！

03:41.354 --> 03:45.112
What's the quickest route
to Bikini Bottom High School?
最快的路线是什么
去比基尼高中？

03:45.216 --> 03:47.043
I want to pick up my friends!
我要接我的朋友们！

03:47.423 --> 03:48.664
Friends?
朋友们？

03:48.767 --> 03:51.733
I don't want any greasy
teenagers in this boat!
我不想要任何油腻的东西
这艘船上的青少年！

03:51.836 --> 03:53.560
- What?
- Uh, I mean...
- 什么？
- 呃，我的意思是...

03:53.664 --> 03:56.560
Turn left at the intersection.
Bing!
在路口左转。
宾！

03:59.974 --> 04:02.388
Honk-honk!
喇叭喇叭！

04:02.491 --> 04:04.940
Cool boat, Pearl!
酷船，珍珠！

04:05.043 --> 04:08.009
Quit gawking, girls,
and hop in!
别再傻眼了，姑娘们，
跳进去！

04:10.560 --> 04:12.802
Pearl! Pearl! Pearl!
珍珠！珍珠！珍珠！

04:20.423 --> 04:23.078
Pearl! Let's have some music!
珍珠！让我们来点音乐吧！

04:24.285 --> 04:26.423
What? SpongeBob!
什么？海绵宝宝！

04:26.526 --> 04:27.629
Start singing!
开始唱歌吧！

04:31.905 --> 04:35.112
My ears!
Ugh! Shut it off!
我的耳朵！
啊!关掉它！

04:37.698 --> 04:38.940
Whoa!
哇！

04:40.664 --> 04:43.940
I hope they didn't crack
my shell open!
我希望它们没有破裂
我的壳打开了！

04:45.595 --> 04:48.560
Oof! Hit the brakes, boy-o!
钱币！踩刹车，孩子！

04:56.871 --> 04:59.078
Hey, nice wheels, Pearl.
嘿，漂亮的轮子，珍珠。

04:59.181 --> 05:01.836
I never thought an old skinflint
like your dad
我从没想过一个老顽皮的人
像你爸爸一样

05:01.940 --> 05:03.871
would buy you a boat!
会给你买条船！

05:03.974 --> 05:05.698
Who's this hoodlum calling old?
这个流氓叫谁老？

05:05.802 --> 05:07.836
Take a hike, Sharkface!
去远足吧，鲨鱼脸！

05:07.940 --> 05:10.319
Unless you want a shark race?
除非你想要一场鲨鱼竞赛？

05:10.423 --> 05:12.147
Ooh!
哦！

05:12.250 --> 05:14.526
A cheerleader race, huh?
啦啦队比赛，是吧？

05:14.629 --> 05:16.629
Hold on to your pom-poms!
抓紧你的绒球！

05:16.733 --> 05:18.698
Ra-ra-ra!
啦啦啦！

05:18.802 --> 05:20.457
R-r-r-race?
R-R-R-竞赛？

05:20.560 --> 05:21.595
Oh no!
哦不！

05:21.698 --> 05:23.043
A race?
一场比赛？

05:23.147 --> 05:24.767
Oh yes!
哦是的！

05:24.871 --> 05:26.319
Take a break, SpongeBob.
休息一下吧，海绵宝宝。

05:26.423 --> 05:29.181
This pompadoured punk is mine!
这个留着浓密头发的小混混是我的！

05:52.112 --> 05:55.285
Mr. Krabs, don't you think
we should slow down a little?
蟹老板，你不觉得吗
我们应该放慢一点吗？

05:55.388 --> 05:56.871
We can't slow down now!
我们现在不能放慢脚步！

05:56.974 --> 05:59.457
I got this snot-nose
right where I want him!
我有这个鼻涕
就在我想要他的地方！

06:02.181 --> 06:04.629
Pearl! Pearl! Pearl! Pearl!
珍珠！珍珠！珍珠！珍珠！

06:05.940 --> 06:08.664
Sink your teeth into those!
把你的牙齿埋进去吧！

06:17.940 --> 06:20.871
Oh, the agony of defeat!
哦，失败的痛苦！

06:20.974 --> 06:22.940
That's it, boy-o!
I need all your legs!
就是这样，男孩！
我需要你所有的腿！

06:23.043 --> 06:24.526
As fast as you can grow 'em!
尽可能快地种植它们！

06:24.974 --> 06:27.388
Ooh! I smell a plan!
哦！我闻到了计划的味道！

06:33.423 --> 06:36.147
Go get 'em, boat!
Sic 'em!
快去抓住他们吧，船！
死吧！

06:40.423 --> 06:44.112
Cheerleaders should stay
on their astro-turf
啦啦队应该留下来
在他们的太空草皮上

06:44.216 --> 06:46.043
and off the road!
并离开道路！

06:57.905 --> 07:00.423
You seem to have dropped these.
你好像把这些都丢掉了。

07:08.733 --> 07:11.078
Mommy!
妈妈！

07:16.974 --> 07:20.319
My heart is racing faster
than those sharks!
我的心跳得更快
比那些鲨鱼！

07:20.423 --> 07:22.216
I want more excitement!
我想要更多的刺激！

07:22.319 --> 07:23.009
More thrills!
更多惊险刺激！

07:23.112 --> 07:25.560
More vehicular mayhem!
更多车辆混乱！

07:25.664 --> 07:28.354
Yeah, like a demolition derby!
是的，就像一场拆除德比！

07:28.457 --> 07:29.388
What?
什么？

07:29.491 --> 07:32.767
Yeah, like a demolition derby!
是的，就像一场拆除德比！

07:32.871 --> 07:35.285
Who said that?
That's a great idea!
谁说的？
这是个好主意！

07:35.388 --> 07:37.802
My boat is invincible!
我的船是无敌的！

07:46.560 --> 07:48.354
Hello, boys!
哈喽，孩子们！

07:54.043 --> 07:56.043
Pearl, Pearl!
She's our whale!
珍珠，珍珠！
她是我们的鲸鱼！

07:56.147 --> 07:57.802
She is much too big to fail!
她太大了，不能失败！

07:57.905 --> 07:59.974
Go, Pearl!
走吧，珍珠！

08:00.078 --> 08:03.181
Here's my Pearl Girl Twirl Hurl!
这是我的珍珠女孩旋转投掷！

08:17.285 --> 08:20.664
If we don't get out of here,
Pearl's gonna get us killed!
如果我们不离开这里
珀尔会害死我们的！

08:20.767 --> 08:24.112
How about a Blowhole Blast!
气孔爆炸怎么样！

08:29.078 --> 08:32.043
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

08:32.940 --> 08:35.216
Pearl! Pearl! Pearl!
珍珠！珍珠！珍珠！

08:36.664 --> 08:38.560
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

08:38.664 --> 08:40.078
What a rush!
多么匆忙啊！

08:40.181 --> 08:42.767
I'm a demolition whale, baby!
我是一头破坏鲸，宝贝！

08:50.595 --> 08:51.871
Oh, no!
哦，不！

08:51.974 --> 08:53.905
What did I do to my new boat?
我对我的新船做了什么？

08:54.009 --> 08:55.802
Daddy's gonna kill me!
爸爸要杀了我！

08:59.595 --> 09:02.526
Uh-oh, that doesn't sound good.
呃哦，这听起来不太好。

09:02.629 --> 09:04.457
Sounds like my dad
in the bathroom.
听起来像我爸爸
在浴室里。

09:04.560 --> 09:05.905
Yeah, sounds to me like
是的，对我来说听起来像

09:06.009 --> 09:09.216
your engine is dying
a slow, agonizing death.
你的引擎快要死了
缓慢而痛苦的死亡。

09:09.319 --> 09:11.836
Let's get it on the lift
and fix 'er up.
让我们把它拿到电梯上
并修复它。

09:11.940 --> 09:13.974
Oh, thank you!
哦，谢谢你！

09:20.802 --> 09:22.009
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

09:22.112 --> 09:24.560
Well, young lady,
I found the trouble...
嗯，年轻的女士，
我发现了麻烦...

09:26.767 --> 09:28.423
You got two knuckleheads
你有两个傻瓜

09:28.526 --> 09:29.767
instead of an engine!
而不是发动机！

09:29.871 --> 09:32.250
Daddy?
爸爸？

09:32.354 --> 09:35.457
What are you doing hiding
inside of my boat?
你躲起来做什么
在我的船里面？

09:35.560 --> 09:37.043
I just wanted to build you
我只是想塑造你

09:37.147 --> 09:40.457
a special boat
for your birthday!
一艘特殊的船
为了你的生日！

09:40.560 --> 09:41.733
Tell her, SpongeBob!
告诉她，海绵宝宝！

09:41.836 --> 09:43.664
Ooh, yeah! I remember!
哦，是啊！我记得！

09:43.767 --> 09:45.181
Mr. Krabs said...
蟹老板说……

09:45.285 --> 09:48.216
I'm not payin'
10,000 clams for a new boat!
我不付钱
一艘新船需要一万只蛤蜊！

09:48.319 --> 09:50.664
Pearl will never know
the difference!
珍珠永远不会知道
区别！

09:50.767 --> 09:52.423
Never mind!
没关系！

09:52.526 --> 09:55.216
Listen to me, Pearl,
I think what we have here
听我说，珍珠，
我想我们这里有什么

09:55.319 --> 09:58.526
is simply a failure
to commiserate!
简直就是失败
表示同情！

09:59.078 --> 10:00.836
I've heard enough
from you, Daddy!
我已经听够了
来自你，爸爸！

10:00.940 --> 10:03.319
You tried to cheap out
like always,
你试图便宜
像往常一样，

10:03.423 --> 10:06.354
and gift me a piece of junk
for my birthday!
并送我一件垃圾
为了我的生日！

10:06.457 --> 10:10.181
Well, when you say it like that
it sounds bad, yeah...
好吧，当你这样说的时候
听起来很糟糕，是的...

10:10.285 --> 10:11.560
Ooh!
哦！

10:11.664 --> 10:13.905
I see the real trouble now.
我现在看到了真正的麻烦。

10:17.043 --> 10:21.009
You got a credit card in
your pocket that needs charging!
您有一张信用卡
你的口袋需要充电！

10:21.112 --> 10:23.491
And I'm gonna charge
a new boat on it!
我要收费
上面有一艘新船！

10:23.595 --> 10:25.043
Ha! Maybe two!
哈!也许两个！

10:25.147 --> 10:29.043
I just happen to have two
new boats for sale right here!
我只是碰巧有两个
新船就在这里出售！

10:29.147 --> 10:31.905
But they're very expensive.
但它们非常昂贵。

10:35.250 --> 10:38.733
Wait, wait, wait, no! Wait!
等等，等等，等等，不！等待！

10:38.836 --> 10:41.250
I got two boats!
I'm not bratty!
我有两艘船！
我不淘气！

10:41.354 --> 10:43.974
I got two boats
to spite my daddy!
我有两艘船
来侮辱我的爸爸！

我有两艘船
来侮辱我的爸爸！